Gifscythe License Notice
========================

Gifscythe (the GUI and control-layer code under working_code/gifscythe/) is
intended to be distributed under the GNU General Public License version 3
(or, at your option, any later version), consistent with the Caesium UI/UX
base (GPLv3) that the product adapts.

The bundled gifsicle engine is a SEPARATE PROGRAM, invoked as a subprocess.
gifsicle is Copyright (C) Eddie Kohler and is licensed under the GNU General
Public License, Version 2 ONLY. See COPYING.gifsicle and
reference_code/gifsicle/COPYING.

Because gifsicle is GPL v2-only, it is NEVER linked into the Gifscythe binary.
Shipping gifsicle alongside Gifscythe requires redistributing its license text
(COPYING.gifsicle) and offering its corresponding source (the reference_code/
gifsicle tree, or upstream https://github.com/kohler/gifsicle).

Qt is used under the LGPL v3 (or a commercial Qt license, if you have one).

For the full GPLv2 text covering the engine, see COPYING.gifsicle.
For the full GPLv3 text, see https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html
(or the COPYING file shipped with a full source release).
